<p>Creates a temporal echo in a radius of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> around you.  Affected targets take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">134, 180, 216, 246, 273</acronym> temporal damage, as well as up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">17%, 25%, 30%, 33%, 36%</acronym> of the difference between their current life and max life as additional temporal damage.</p><p>The additional damage will be divided by the target's rank and the damage scales with your Spellpower.</p>